                        "review": "The hotel is pretty bad actually, that game title doesn't lie\n\nI mean, real talk, from back when it first came out on mobile in like 2012 or whatever it was fine, but the standards were pretty low back then and we were only a few years past thinking a fake beer drinking app was peak & using a fake razor app to scare your friends into thinking your turning them bald was the height of comedy\n\nBut spending money on this in current era? Maybe if you've got nostalgia from it or just want to experience it since it is pretty unique, and it is pretty cheap.",
